  "subject": "🎉 Your listing is LIVE on NIRVANA MART!",
  "html": "<div style='font-family:Segoe UI,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#f5f5f5;padding:24px;border-radius:12px;'><div style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669);padding:32px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;'><div style='font-size:3.5rem;margin-bottom:8px;'>🚀</div><h1 style='color:white;margin:0;font-size:1.3rem;'>Your Product is Live!</h1></div><div style='background:white;padding:24px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:20px;'><p style='color:#333;'>Hi <strong>{{ $('Webhook: Product Status Changed').first().json.body.seller_name }}</strong>,</p><p style='color:#555;line-height:1.7;'>Great news! Your listing <strong>{{ $('Webhook: Product Status Changed').first().json.body.product_title }}</strong> at <strong>₹{{ $('Webhook: Product Status Changed').first().json.body.price }}</strong> has been approved and is now live on NIRVANA MART!</p><p style='color:#555;'>Students can now find and purchase your item. You'll be notified when someone places an order.</p></div><div style='text-align:center;'><a href='https://nirvana-mart.onrender.com/shop' style='display:inline-block;background:#10b981;color:white;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;'>View Your Listing →</a></div><p style='color:#aaa;font-size:0.78rem;text-align:center;margin-top:20px;'>NIRVANA MART — Campus Marketplace</p></div>"
}

={
